ERROR HY000: MooseDB: index 'PRIMARY' is not supported: column 'ns' is not a TAG column or the timestamp column. MooseDB indexes the timestamp column alone, or TAG columns optionally followed by the timestamp (INDEX (itemid, clock)). A MooseDB UNIQUE/PRIMARY key is (every TAG column, the timestamp column [, up to 2 integer NOT NULL columns]), e.g. PRIMARY KEY (itemid, clock, ns)
